invariants:
- Render requires one exact target-resolved UI Surface V0112 artifact.
- Render requires one exact hash-bound Theme Binding V0106 artifact.
- theme_ref is derived only from theme_binding_artifact.effective_theme_ref.
- UI Surface content hash and Theme Binding content hash are preserved in the Render Artifact.
- Render does not mutate Business Domain data, Surface semantic structure, or Theme authority.
- Missing or invalid Theme material fails closed before Render Artifact creation.
